<title>CHINA: China's Jan-July cereal imports detailed.</title>
<headline>China's Jan-July cereal imports detailed.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following table shows the wheat, barley, corn and rice import figures of up to five major Chinese offices as well as the country of origin during January-Ju1y 1996.</p>
<p>Details were provided by the General Administration of Customs of China.</p>
<p>Figures are in tonnes. Percentage represents the share of the total market. Percentages may not add up to 100 percent as details of some smaller import regions and supplying countries have not been included.</p>
