<p>CUSTOMS		July	 Pct	    Jan-July     Pct</p>
<p>Tianjin	   103,490	12.5	  1,201,757     21.0</p>
<p>Shanghai	   71,185	 8.0	    640,151     11.2</p>
<p>Nanjing	   183,749	22.2	    744,406     13.0</p>
